  "goodToKnow": "Die Buchung is a booking or reservation (eine Buchung stornieren, to cancel) and an entry in accounts or on a bank statement: die Abbuchung (debit), die Gutschrift (credit). Buchen means to book: einen Flug, ein Hotel buchen, and to post a transaction. Germans are famously early bookers, with the Frühbucherrabatt (early-bird discount) a staple of travel. Plural: die Buchungen."
